				Intermediate Player Domination Swiss SFT 05/15/2026Current Time: 21.6.2026, 16:48:01Checkins Begin at: 15.5.2026, 20:00:00Tournament Starts at: 15.5.2026, 21:00:00Login to Sign Up For TournamentsTournament InfoDescriptionBracketSignupsDescriptionCommunication:Use the RTK Server channel intermediate-tournaments (link below) to declare your faction and contact your opponents. Please DM RTK | Byrd with questions. https://discord.gg/5XzwuamCvpA Domination Swiss Single Faction Tournament for Intermediate Players.5 round Swiss format with a Top 4 Finalist Single Elimination.Eligibility:Players may participate in this tournament until they have won a Total Tavern tournament without any player restrictions, and as long as they are not top 16 players in either current or past seasons. Each time a player wins an Intermediate Tournament, the faction played in that victory becomes locked for that player in future Intermediate Tournaments hosted by RTK.The host has full discretion over participant eligibility. If the host determines that a player is not a good fit for the event for any reason, that player will be excluded from participation.This tournament will not count towards the leader-board! Rules:⦿ Default Funds⦿ Ultra Unit Scale⦿ 1500 Tickets⦿ Unit Caps On⦿ Players may only play a single faction for the entirety of the event.⦿ During the check in period (up to 1 hour before the tournament starts), declare your faction in the RTK Server "intermediate-tournaments" channel. ⦿ Custom Unit Limits:◦ The Masque of Slaanesh is banned.◦ Slaangors and Forsaken limited to a combined 6.◦ Fiends, Pleasureseekers and champions of SL combined limit of 2.◦ Chimera is restricted to 1.◦ Dreadmaw is banned.◦ Exalted hero of SL on a mount counts towards chaos marks on WoC.◦ Horsemen and Horsemasters combined limit of 4 for both NR + WoC.◦ Gladeguard Starfire Shafts and Hagbane Tips combined limit of 5, regular glade guard does not count. Exploitation of bugs whether intentional or not, may forfeit you the round and all cases should be repo

