				PopePady's Snipe Single-ElimCurrent Time: 21.6.2026, 16:48:05Checkins Begin at: 12.5.2026, 18:00:00Tournament Starts at: 12.5.2026, 19:00:00Login to Sign Up For TournamentsTournament InfoDescriptionBracketSignupsDescriptionUsing this link https://aoe2cm.net/preset/NpwXM, each player blind picks 3 factions, one at a time, then snipes 2 of their opponents factions. Sniping is done in the same way as faction selection, but you can only select the factions your opponent has chosen. At the end, each player will have one faction remaining, deciding the match up. So, to be clear here, we are NOT using the matrix format in this tourney to select match-ups.  ───────── Restrictions───────── Masque bannedChimera RoR bannedSlaanesh limited to max of 6 combined limit of forsaken and slaangorsLocus of Conjuration BannedChalice of Blood & Darkness Banned  ─────────── Rules ───────────  - Unit Caps on - Default funds and Ultra unit scale - 1500 tickets - No character loading - All rounds, excluding the finals, must be completed and reported within 40 minutes of start of round.If your opponent doesn't show up or is not ready after 15 min, message PopePady and take the win as a mirror match.If a game crashes, send the replay to PopePady. He will decide the winner.Make sure you click the Check-In Button on website before the start time.   ─────────── Maps─────────── Mod Required: Total Tavern Tournament Map Pack: https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2875865414Map Pictures: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/11x_snSEXY8Q3hYA0SyRX9FtuqAb_ma30c3bwYJvJcHE/edit?gid=0#gid=0  Round 1: Altar of the Champion / Blasphemous Snowfield / Twilight Forest Round 2: Road to Vaul's Anvil / The Sword of the Lake / Sunken Mire Round 3: Skjlalandir's Cave / Bordeleaux Landing / Khsar's Cursed OasisRound 4: Whirling Maelstrom / Halls of Karag Dum / Haunted ValeRound 5: Edge of the Darkwood / Creeping Swamp / Imperial RoadBracketRefresh Bracket0:PopePady1:scrambledeggspecial#011:PopePady0:Byrd21:scrambledeggspecial#00:turtlesareme#03

